// | imm[11:5]    | rs2   | rs1   | funct3 | imm[4:0]    | opcode |  S-type, S-imm
// | imm[12|10:5] | rs2   | rs1   | funct3 | imm[4:1|11] | opcode |  SB-type,B-imm
